That is more exact than calling every artifact \'93source code.\'94 A family photograph is not executable instruction in the same way that the board\'92s upload procedure is, but it is still indispensable training data for the self the procedure attempts to reconstruct. This layered model also explains why ordinary objects matter without requiring every banana, dog, or childhood picture to be an occult sacrament.\
