I inspected all 44 screenshot files representing 43 distinct board views; one pair is an exact duplicate. This closes the previous draft\'92s disclosed gap of 21 unread frames. I also audited all fourteen transcript dossiers, ran additional checks on the two extra audio artifacts, and cross-checked the resulting claims against 692 Markdown files across the JagwarTwin vault, deep-reading the affected Brain, Sources, Essays, staging, and System nodes.\
