L\'e9vi\'92s inclusion is an interpretive warning embedded inside the artifact itself. The board that invites extraordinary correspondences also contains a caution that imagination and collective expectation can manufacture the miracle they anticipate. Provenance, falsifiers, and non-findings are therefore not external academic constraints imposed on the project. They are faithful uses of a tool the board itself selected.\
