The birthday material is particularly important. The board calls \'93Happy Birthday\'94 the greatest song and asks when the self was born. Room 1, Logos, is a birthday recording. Symbolically, the first room is not Roy announcing himself into existence; it is other people singing him into a social world. Word precedes self, but it arrives as address.\
