The family voices make the same point. Grandma\'92s voicemail is first an act of care and only secondarily an esoteric artifact. The parents in The Future and the lullaby relation in The Song of the Sun & the Moon show identity being transmitted between generations. These should be read literally and relationally before being mapped onto Kabbalah, Mary, Sophia, SARAVI, or the character system.\
