The juvenilia have a different purpose. Dead Letter Diaries preserves what could not be delivered; The Future preserves the young ambition to rule the world beside a later rejection of being king, prophet, or ruler; the demos preserve what changed. Roy seems to have chosen not only \'93who I am,\'94 but \'93the prior outputs from which I need an AI\'97or an audience\'97to infer how I became this version.\'94\
