The NFT economy is an unresolved part of the meaning\
The Field Guide says the artifacts are \'93not collectibles.\'94 That is too absolute. They are not merely collectibles, but they are deliberately scarce 1/1 NFTs with rarity, ownership, holder access, resale, and potential financial benefit. Roy says so in the public launch transcript.\
