This creates a genuine ethical tension rather than a packaging footnote. The Hall rejects money as the primary gate and rewards attention, but it also turns accumulated attention into rarity, access, status, and economic capital. The same project that contains Room 116\'92s confession about specialness creates crowns, rankings, rare discoveries, and \'93winning.\'94\
